OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 16 Nov to Wed 25 Nov
OL,6,FFollowing the tail end of the colder,
OL,7,Fmore settled conditions seen over the
OL,8,Fweekend, a marked transition to more
OL,9,Fchangeable conditions is expected at
OL,10,Fthe start of the period. This will
OL,11,Fallow areas of low pressure to move in
OL,12,Ffrom the Atlantic and bring bands of
OL,13,Frain and periods of windy weather.
OL,14,FThere will be some brighter, showery
OL,15,Fspells in-between however,
OL,16,Fparticularly in the north. Overall,
OL,17,Fthis period is likely to be wetter
OL,18,Fthan average for the majority of the
OL,19,Fcountry. And whilst colder conditions
OL,20,Fwill be possible at times, it will
OL,21,Foften be mild, with temperatures near
OL,22,For a little above average for the time
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fof year.
